     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">中共绍兴市教育局委员会<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">创先争优活动工作思路</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正大标宋简体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>一、指导思想<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">认真贯彻落实党的十七大和十七届五中全会精神，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">按照</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">市委市政府“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">致力转型促发展、强化宗旨惠民生、创先争优开好局<SPAN style="COLOR: black">”</SPAN>的工作基调，</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">围绕绍兴市“十二五”教育发展规划，全面贯彻落实科学发展观，科学谋划，创新思路，充分发挥党组织的战斗堡垒作用和广大党员的先锋模范作用，为推进绍兴市教育现代化建设提供强大动力。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正大黑简体">二、</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">工作任务<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>（一）围绕一条主线，服务中心工作<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">以科学发展观为指导，紧紧围绕</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">“实施优先优质发展、推进教育现代化”</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">这条主线，全面提升服务全局中心工作、重点工作的能力。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>（二）明确两种关系，突出重点工作<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>要在<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>创<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>与<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>争<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>上下功夫，明确创先争优与加强学校党组织建设的关系；要在<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>先<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>与<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>优<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>上下功夫，明确创先争优与惠民利民之间的关系。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">1.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">突出领导班子建设和党员干部队伍建设。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">努力实现领导班子好、党员队伍好、工作机制好、工作业绩好、群众反映好的“五好”目标。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">突出学校党组织能力建设。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">进一步加强学校党建工作，提升学校党组织能力，努力构建学校党建工作新格局。推进党员教育管理服务工作，切实加强学习型党组织建设，提升各级领导干部的理论素养和实践能力。<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                  </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">3.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">突出惠民生促和谐。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">把改善民生、促进教育和谐作为创先争优活动的落脚点，努力让广大家长和学生共享活动成果。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>（三）坚持三点结合，抓实三个层面<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2011</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">年的创先争优活动要注重点、线、面的充分结合，形成活动合力。要做到点上带动。坚</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">持在挖掘典型、培育典型、树立典型上做文章，积极挖掘、发现机关党总支、各基层学校、直属事业单位中存在的“闪光言行”，做好向省市活动领导部门推荐宣传工作，充分发挥先进学校党组织和优秀共产党员的示范带动作用，<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">继续</SPAN>着力培育具有示范带动效应的示范学校、示范党支部、示范党员。打造一批学校党建示范点，深化、巩固、拓展党建带工建、带团建、带妇建工作。打造一批“两型”（学习型、创新型）党员教师“青年号”团队。要做到线上拉动。针对不同层面、学校的特点分类指导，引导各级党组织和广大党员积极创新活动载体，丰富活动内涵。要做到面上推动。坚持<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>以党建带群建，以群建促党建<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>的工作方针，深入开展以<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>党建带工建<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>党建带妇建<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>党建带团建<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>为主要内容的党群共建创先争优活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">同时，在工作中要抓实局机关、各县（市、区）教育局、市属学校基层党组织三个层面的分类指导工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">局机关层面要推进工作提速、提效、提标、提质，</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">围绕绍兴市“十二五”教育发展规划、<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年局教育工作目标，进一步解放思想，坚定信心，发扬“干”字当头精神，坚持抓学习、抓活动、抓制度、抓考评，使机关各项工作速度更快、效率更佳，标准更高，质量更优。各县（市、区）教育局层面要做好工作指导，要主动加强各县（市、区）所属学校创先争优活动领导小组的联系沟通，根据市委要</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">求，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">及时传达上级指示精神，</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">及时指导帮助，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">明确每个阶段的创先争优活动内容及要求，拓宽工作思路，</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">加强创先争优活动的检查指导，做好活动各阶段工作的查漏补缺，扎实地推动各县（市、区）教育系统开展创先争优活动的各项工作</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;">。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学校基层党组织层面要注重工作结合、实践创新。学校基层党组织开展创先争优活动，要和现已开展的各项教育教学工作结合起来，尤其要与建立健全学习实践科学发展观长效机制、建设学习型党组织、争创家长满意学校等有机结合起来，努力做到活动与工作<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>两不误<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>两促进<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>。鼓励和支持学校基层党组织探索符合本校实际的活动组织形式、实践载体和方式方法，创造性地开展活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>（四）抓好四个贯穿，把握四个节点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.99"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">1.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">要把创先争优活动与中心工作相结合贯穿始终。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">教育系统各级党组织把开展中心工作与创先争优活动有机结合，以中心工作成果来检验创先争优活动效果。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">要把</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 楷体_GB2312">“</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">公开承诺</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 楷体_GB2312">”</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">活动贯穿始终。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">抓实抓好学校党组织和党员公开承诺，坚持“承诺必践诺”，做到“三个进一步”。要进一步细化承诺。学校基层党组织要围绕自身建设以及为群众办实事，在加强学校基层组织建设和加快教育发展、促进校园和谐等方面，进一步修订争创目标，作出公开承诺；学校要对所结对社区、村在原有承诺基础上进一步做出公开承诺、践行承诺。党员要根据围绕本职岗位和教育教学管理实际，结合结对共建实践活动，进一步拓展帮扶渠道、强化帮扶措施、注重帮扶实效，把公开承诺进一步具体化、明确化，做到切合实际能兑现。要进一步明确步骤。按照宣传动员、征求意见、提出承诺、支部讨论、组织审定、公开承诺等步骤推进承诺工作，切实做到“征求意见不广不承诺、承诺事项不实不送审、审核不通过不公示”。要进一步落实落实领导点评。建立《党组织公开承诺台账》和《党员履职践诺台账》，专人负责管理，并报上级党组织备案，接受上级党组织和党员群众的“双向监督”。党组织和党员的承诺要作为领导点评承诺活动成效的依据。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">3.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">要将建立健全长效机制贯穿始终。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">深入开展创先争优活动，就是要着眼于促进各项工作的规范化、制度化、科学化，建立健全包括党建工作在内的各项规章制度，形成长效机制，改进工作作风，促进工作落实，提高工作效能。重点加强两方面制度建设：一是继续从加强党员教师思想教育、党员教师业务培训以及党员教师典型带动入手，建立健全<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>党员素质提高机制<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>。二是继续从征求群众意见、强化服务群众意识着手，建立健全<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>党员服务群众机制<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">4.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">要把群众监督评议贯穿始终。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">坚持开门搞活动，把群众参与始终贯穿到创先争优活动的各个阶段，采取适当有效方式，在践行承诺、树立典型等环节认真接受群众监督，切实增强创先争优活动效果。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年底前，要再次组织开展创先争优活动党员群众评议工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">2011</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">年创先争优活动共分四个阶段：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>第一阶段<SPAN lang=EN-US>:</SPAN>年初至春节前。普遍开展领导点评和民主评议党员工作，扎实推进教育系统“送温暖惠民大行动”，启动创先争优“闪光言行”展示评选活动，全面开展新一轮基层党组织和党员公开承诺活动；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">第二阶段：春节后至“七一”建党节前。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">开展“三重三坚定”纪念建党<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>周年系列活动，十七届五中全会形势政策宣传教育工作，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">突出做好“创先争优闪光言行”展示评选工作；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>第三阶段：“七一”后至年底前。学习贯彻国家领导人庆祝建党节重要讲话精神，围绕迎接党的十八大召开，引导教育系统党组织和广大党员以昂扬向上的精神风貌，全面加强党的基层组织建设，开展以“关爱学生、助推发展”为主题的争创行动；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">第四阶段：年底前后。组织开展创先争优活动党员群众评议工作。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正大黑简体"><FONT size=5>三、工作重点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.05pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>（一）开展“三重三坚定”系列活动，纪念建党<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>周年。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>今年“七一”前夕要着重围绕迎接中国共产党成立<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>周年开展创先争优活动，引导学校党组织切实履职发挥战斗堡垒作用、共产党员立足岗位争创一流业绩。响应市委“越州儿女跟党走”庆祝主题，市属教育系统也要相应开展教育系统庆祝建党<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>周年系列活动，分三个阶段，开展以“三重三坚定”为主要内容的活动，掀起创先争优活动高潮。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第一阶段：<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>月中旬到<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日前，主题是“重读党的历史，坚定信念”。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">要以深入学习党的理论、党的历史、党的知识为主，包括我们党领导我们走改革开放之路、建设中国特色社会主义，推进科学发展的发展史。一是要大力宣传改革开放以来，特别是“十一五”以来的发展成果，大力宣传党的十七届五中全会精神，深入理解在当代中国坚持发展是硬道理的本质要求就是科学发展。二是要辅以形式多样、内容生动活泼、寓教于乐的活动，可以以校为单位组织学生唱红歌比赛、组织师生观看革命题材的优秀影片等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第二阶段：<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日到<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日，主题是“重温入党誓言，坚定党的宗旨”。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">这一阶段重点是大力宣传优秀共产党员的先进事迹，在<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>七<SPAN lang=EN-US>·</SPAN>一<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>期间开展选树<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>教坛红烛<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>典型活动。各校都要在校内树立先进典型，组织本校优秀共产党员事迹报告会，也可以邀请教育系统内外的优秀党员来校作事迹介绍，形成一个学习优秀党员、争当优秀党员的学习、宣传高潮。充分发挥先进典型的示范引领作用，积极营造<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>人人学习先进、个个争当优秀<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>的良好氛围；激发广大党员干事创业的责任感和使命感，着力引导学校党组织和广大党员以昂扬向上的精神风貌、更加出色的工作业绩向党的华诞献礼。二是各校党组织要组织一次以党员重温入党誓言、坚定党的宗旨为主题的党员民主生活会，每位党员都谈谈自己的理想，与实现“全心全意为人民服务”这一党的宗旨，所作出的自己的一份努力与贡献。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第三阶段：<?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="1" Month="7" Year="2011"><SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>到<st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="1" Month="9" Year="2011"><SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>，主题是“重访革命旧址，坚定理想”。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">一是各校可以组织先进教师、优秀党员参加重访革命老区的“红色之旅”活动，市教育局也考虑与市教育工会一起，组织开展“红色之旅”活动；二是以深入开展创先争优活动为主题，以体现广大教育系统党员干部综合素质和文化实力为目标，组织开展全市教育系统教职工纪念建党<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>周年书画比赛，为创先争优活动助力；三是表彰优秀党员、优秀党务工作者<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">。</B></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">在“七一”前评选表彰一批优秀共产党员、优秀党务工作者。结合“创先争优闪光言行”展示评选活动，择优评选表彰“创先争优闪光言行”<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>例，并推荐参加全省“先锋浙江·创先争优闪光言行”的评选，并做好省级“十大之江先锋”评选的推荐工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=5><B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（二）开展以党的十七届五中全会精神为主要内容的形势政策宣传教育。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">为深入学习宣传贯彻党的十七届五中全会精神，中央决定从现在开始到<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年“五一”前，集中开展形势政策宣传教育。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -12.5pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-right: -.78gd"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">活动内容：</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）以“回顾辉煌成就、展望美好蓝图”为主线，开展专题学习。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">各在绍高校、市直中小学校、直属事业单位党组织要以“回顾辉煌成就、展望美好蓝图”为主线，把党的十七届五中全会精神作为学习的重要内容深入学习宣传，集中开展形势政策宣传教育的重点是要把党的十七届五中全会的重大意义和主要精神讲透彻，把“十一五”时期的巨大成就和宝贵经验讲充分，把“十二五”时期的目标任务和重大举措讲明白。同时要进一步结合绍兴市教育实际，广泛开展绍兴教育“十一五”的辉煌成果宣教，围绕绍兴市“十二五”教育发展规划，展望未来，提前谋划，提前布局，做好本单位的发展规划。各级党组织要按照形势政策宣传教育重点内容组织<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>次以上形式多样化的专题学习，其中一次可邀请省市专家作一次主题报告。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）以“回顾‘十一五’、展望‘十二五’”为主题，发动多种活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">机关党总支、学校和直属事业单位等党组织要以迎接建党<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>周年为契机，组织开展以“回顾‘十一五’、展望‘十二五’”为主题的支部学习、图片展览、知识竞赛、演讲征文、文艺表演等活动，运用各种资源和渠道，鼓励党员干部群众联系身边变化谈形势、谈发展、谈规划、谈未来，自我教育，自我提高。</SPAN><?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t202 path="m,l,21600r21600,l21600,xe" o:spt="202" coordsize="21600,21600"> <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:path o:connecttype="rect" gradientshapeok="t"></v:path></v:shapetype></FONT><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: 240.85pt; Z-INDEX: 1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.35pt; WIDTH: 2.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 97.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-wrap-edited: f; mso-wrap-distance-left: 0; mso-wrap-distance-right: 0; mso-position-horizontal-relative: page; mso-position-vertical-relative: page" stroked="f" o:allowincell="f" wrapcoords="-62 0 -62 21600 21662 21600 21662 0 -62 0" type="#_x0000_t202"><v:fill opacity="0"></v:fill><v:textbox style="LAYOUT-FLOW: vertical-ideographic" inset="0,0,0,0"></v:textbox><?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" /><w:wrap type="square" anchory="page" anchorx="page"></w:wrap></v:shape><FONT size=5><IMG class=shape height=134 src="file:///C:/DOCUME~1/admin/LOCALS~1/Temp/msohtml1/01/clip_image001.gif" width=9 align=left v:dpi="96" v:shapes="_x0000_s1026"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）以“回眸展望、提振信心”为重点，组织宣传报道。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">各学校党组织要注重宣传报道，精心组织，统筹安排，集中报道，形成声势，为形势政策宣传教育营造浓厚的舆论氛围。通过集中一段时间的广泛宣传教育、学习培训，确保党的十七届五中全会精神深入人心，确保宣传教育全覆盖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -12.5pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-right: -.78gd"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">时间安排：形势政策集中宣传教育活动从<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月启动，到<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011 </SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月结束，分三个阶段：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -12.5pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-right: -.78gd"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）动员部署阶段（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>-2</SPAN>月）。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">制定宣传教育工作计划，全面部署。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -12.5pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-right: -.78gd"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）学习宣讲阶段（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月至<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月中旬）。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">重点是集中学习宣传党的十七届五中全会精神，学习宣传“十一五”时期取得的巨大成就和“十二五”规划《建议》的主要内容、省委十二届八次全会精神、市委六届十次全会精神，学习宣传全国、省、市“两会”精神和“十二五”规划纲要，市委重要战略部署。广泛开展绍兴教育“十一五”的辉煌成果宣教，围绕绍兴市“十二五”教育发展规划，展望未来。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -12.5pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-right: -.78gd"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）深化总结阶段（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月下旬至<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月）。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">认真做好形势政策宣传教育工作总结，进一步把学习教育和实践活动引向深入。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -12.5pt 0pt 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-right: -.78gd"><B><SPAN style="COLOR: #242424; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>（三）开展以“关爱学生、助推发展”为主题的争创行动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 1.15pt 0pt 0cm; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=5>各级基层党组织要创新“五好”基层党组织创建载体，引导广大教职工把思想和行动进一步凝聚到培养学生、促进学校发展上来，自觉提高教学质量，着力培养创新创业人才。要围绕“关爱学生、助推发展”的总主题，制定符合本校实际的创先争优活动主题，通过载体多样的创建活动，对学生的思想、学习、就业创业等提供更多的热心关怀和悉心帮助，强化全员育人、争创先进的浓厚氛围。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
